Package: educabr2
Title: Harmonized Historical Series on Brazilian Education
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tales", "Mançano",
           email = "mancano.tales@usp.br",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5923-9743")),
    person("Victor", "Alcantara",
           email = "victorgalcantara@usp.br",
           role = "ctb",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8846-9652")))
Description: Provides curated long-run series on Brazilian formal education,
    with a focus on school enrollment, educational attainment (years of
    schooling, literacy, level completion), public expenditure and grade
    progression. Data are compiled and reconciled from heterogeneous official
    sources (Censo Escolar, PNAD, Censo Demográfico, Anuário Estatístico do
    IBGE, INEP CENSUP) and academic compilations, notably Kang, Paese and
    Felix (2021) <doi:10.1017/S0212610921000112>, Kang and Menetrier (2024)
    <doi:10.1590/1980-53575434tkim>, Walter and Kang (2024)
    <doi:10.1080/20780389.2024.2417268> and Lee and Lee (2016)
    <doi:10.1016/j.jdeveco.2016.05.006>, into a single tidy schema, with
    explicit provenance, enabling descriptive analyses and the study of
    educational inequality across race, sex, income and location.
